    "The function `transform(flow)` receives `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Return an object with `status`, `headers`, `body` to override, or `null` to pass through." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Funktion `transform(flow)` erhält `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Ein Objekt mit `status`, `headers`, `body` zurückgeben, um zu überschreiben, oder `null`, um durchzureichen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La función `transform(flow)` recibe `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Devuelve un objeto con `status`, `headers` y `body` para sobrescribir, o `null` para dejarla pasar sin cambios."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La fonction `transform(flow)` reçoit `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Retournez un objet avec `status`, `headers`, `body` pour surcharger, ou `null` pour laisser passer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La funzione `transform(flow)` riceve `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Restituisci un oggetto con `status`, `headers`, `body` per sovrascrivere, oppure `null` per lasciar passare la richiesta."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`transform(flow)` 関数は `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }` を受け取ります。上書きするには `status`、`headers`、`body` を持つオブジェクトを返し、そのまま通過させるには `null` を返します。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A função `transform(flow)` recebe `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`. Retorne um objeto com `status`, `headers`, `body` para sobrescrever, ou `null` para deixar passar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "函数 `transform(flow)` 接收 `{ request: { url, method, headers, body }, response: { status, headers, body } }`。返回一个包含 `status`、`headers`、`body` 的对象以进行覆盖，或返回 `null` 以直接放行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
